{"format":1,"key":"item:gazlowe-s-ledger","path":"/lore/item/gazlowe-s-ledger","name":"Gazlowe's Ledger","kind":"item","label":"Item","zone":{"key":"barrens","name":"The Barrens","path":"/lore/zone/barrens"},"levels":"","description":"In Ratchet, Gazlowe checks his trade records against the harbor manifest when a shipment from Booty Bay goes missing.","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"item:gazlowe-s-ledger","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["In Ratchet, Gazlowe checks his trade records against the harbor manifest when a shipment from Booty Bay goes missing.","Gazlowe tracks trade goods in Ratchet with a personal ledger. It records imported crates, outbound cargo, and warehouse stores. When a shipment from Booty Bay is missing, Gazlowe compares his expected inventory with the dock records kept by Wharfmaster Dizzywig."],"hash":"b59dca","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"d8b08cbd84","sec":23},"female-narrator":{"sha":"c1e719c081","sec":24}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Gazlowe's Ledger","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Gazlowe's_Ledger"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"The Missing Shipment","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/The_Missing_Shipment"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"The Missing Shipment (2)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/The_Missing_Shipment_(2)"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/quest/890-the-missing-shipment","n":"The Missing Shipment","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/ratchet","n":"Ratchet","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1492-wharfmaster-dizzywig","n":"Wharfmaster Dizzywig","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/888-stolen-booty","n":"Stolen Booty","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/887-southsea-freebooters","n":"Southsea Freebooters","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/booty-bay","n":"Booty Bay","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/topic/pirate","n":"Pirate","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/zone/barrens","n":"The Barrens","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/quest/892-the-missing-shipment","n":"The Missing Shipment","k":"quest"}],"wowhead":"item=5080"}
